{"articleNo":"2269","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2269&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] 2008후기 대학원 학위수여예정자 완성본논문 제출안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.02","hit":"19452","attachments":[{"name":"학위논문위임동의서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1508"},{"name":"학위논문작성법.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1704"},{"name":"국문요약형식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1706"},{"name":"CD또는디스켓라벨형식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1829"},{"name":"영문요약형식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1830"},{"name":"2008후기 학위논문심사 결과(공고용).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2269&attachNo=1906"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p>\n<p>&nbsp; 2008후기(2009.8.14졸업예정자) 대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 학위논문심사에<br>합격한 학생은&nbsp;아래와 같이&nbsp;완성본 논문을&nbsp;&nbsp;제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;1. &nbsp;완성논문 제출기간 : <font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 7. 13(월) ~ 7. 15(수)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"></font></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp; 제출물<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 완성본 논문 : 하드바운드 또는 소프트바운드 6부&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② CD 또는 디스켓 1장(라벨 부착)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 논문 전체 수록&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 외국어논문은 국문요약(320자내), 국문논문은 영문 요약(초록) 수록<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 학위논문 사용권 위임 동의서<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">논문 완성본 표지 및 인준페이지 복사본 각1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#808080\"> 3.</font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#808080\"> 제출장소 : 대학원 각 학과 종합학사행정실</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#1e90ff\"><strong>4. 유의사항</strong></font>&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 논문심사결과보고서 상의 제목으로 학위기가 발급되므로 학생 임의로&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 완성본논문의<strong> <u>제목 변경은 불가함</u><font color=\"#ff1493\">(붙임의 논문제목 반드시 확인바람)</font></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 학위논문작성법을 기준으로 완성본을 제작하여야 하며, 특히<br></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#696969\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 국문논문은 영문요약본(초록)을 외국어논문은 국문요약본을 반드시 첨부해야됨</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; <font color=\"#8b008b\">※ <!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;대학원명 오기, 요약본 누락, 임의 제목 변경 등은 &nbsp;완성본 제출 후에도&nbsp;<br></font></strong></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font color=\"#8b008b\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 재 제본해야</font></strong></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font color=\"#8b008b\"><strong>되므로 반드시&nbsp;확인 후&nbsp;제본하시기 바랍니다.</strong>&nbsp;</font>\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;5. 문의사항 :&nbsp; 대학원지원팀(478-7015)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></font></p><font color=\"#000000\">\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#808080\">&nbsp;6. 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 전화번호&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing